<title>FRANCE: Sanofi 1996 net div 6.6 Ffr vs 6.3 Ffr.</title>
<headline>Sanofi 1996 net div 6.6 Ffr vs 6.3 Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in French francs)</p>
<p>    Net dividend				    6.6    vs	6.3</p>
<p>    Pay date					    June 18, 1997.</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave the dividend details in a statement following a March 25 board meeting. The annual shareholders meeting was set for June 4, 1997.</p>
